        "name": "USN-8097-2",
        "description": "USN-8097-1 fixed a vulnerability in roundcube. The update caused a regression affecting the HTML sanitizer, preventing Roundcube from rendering any email message body. This update fixes the problem.  We apologize for the inconvenience.  Original advisory details:   It was discovered that Roundcube Webmail did not properly sanitize the  animate tag within SVG documents. An attacker could possibly use  this issue to cause a cross-site scripting attack.",
